#chip tiny202, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 2 ms (a constant Wait in milliseconds) in a 20 ms loop
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 400,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat for 20 ms
    Wait 2 ms
    PORTA = !PORTA
End Repeat
Do
Loop
